menu "Node app CAN"

    config NODE_APP_TWAI_TX_GPIO
        int "TWAI TX GPIO (to transceiver TXD)"
        range 0 48
        default 4
        help
            Must match the TX pin the updater uses: the board profile in
            cancfg, or GPIO4 when the board has none. The app and the
            updater share one transceiver.

    config NODE_APP_TWAI_RX_GPIO
        int "TWAI RX GPIO (from transceiver RXD)"
        range 0 48
        default 5
        help
            Must match the updater's RX pin (board profile, or GPIO5).

    config NODE_APP_CAN_BITRATE_BPS
        int "CAN bitrate (bit/s)"
        default 250000
        help
            Must match the node updater and the brain (250000 on the bench).
            can_link accepts 10k, 20k, 50k, 100k, 125k, 250k, 500k and 1M.

endmenu
